  "title": "Grandmother&#39;s Old Fashioned Butter Roll",
  "description": "If you like butter, you&#39;ll love these simple but delicious butter rolls. They&#39;re baked in a sweet milk sauce. Just the thing for a cold morning.",
  "authors": [
    "dyoung"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-04-13T17:32:01-04:00",
